# {{ site.name }}

> {{ site.name }} records Clash Royale history the official game API does not keep - battles, progression, clan rosters, and war - and serves it to your own AI agent through an authenticated remote MCP server at {{ site.mcpUrl }}. The official API answers only "what is true right now": a rotating ~30-battle log, no trophy timeline, no season history. This service keeps the record.

Access is approval-gated while the recorder grows; request it at {{ site.url }}/. All recorded GAME data is readable by every approved account, the same posture as the game's public API. ACCOUNT data is private to its owner. Roles never gate what you can read: they set how much the service records for you and how many calls per day your agent gets.
